WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.142
A pivot often does more than change layout.

00:00:03.142 --> 00:00:08.302
Suppose several sales transactions belong to the same product and month.

00:00:08.302 --> 00:00:14.795
If we want only one product and month value in the pivot, those transactions must be combined.

00:00:15.317 --> 00:00:17.779
That means we need an aggregation rule.

00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:21.409
For revenue, we usually add the values together.

00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:29.154
At that point, the transformation is doing two things: reshaping the data and reducing transaction level detail.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:32.619
That is why the aggregation decision must be explicit.
